            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "the cat’s face reflected in the water bowl, <em>very</em> honest blank-stared smirk"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>You were going to serve your time quietly. You were going to be so agreeable that the guards would forget you were even there!</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>You practiced your most honest expression in the reflection of your water bowl until you could hold it for a full minute. When they let you go, you would stay on roads, take work that didn’t involve pockets, and never again go near a bush.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "the water bowl, its surface trembling"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>Somewhere far off, something rumbles. The water shivers. You think it must be a cart.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>The guard arrives with the release ledger. Name, signature, and a line for your surname. You realize you’ve never had one you liked. You think you’ll fix that today.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "next",
        page: 3
      }
    ]
  },
